      "side": 1,
      "message": "The lookup costs one GET of the change\u0027s drafts, about 0.6 s on gerrit-review. A caller does not always know the patch set: in 639424, `post_draft_comment` returns `revision` \"current\" for a draft that is not a reply. With a wrong patch set, Gerrit answers \"Not found\", the same as for a deleted draft. The tool would then need the lookup as a fallback to tell the two apart. I prefer to leave it out until a caller needs it. If you want it, I can add it in a follow up change.",
      "parentUuid": "45f106f9_39ac366c",
